title: arxiv-mcp-server
abstract: "Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for the arXiv preprint repository, providing paper search with field prefixes and boolean operators, metadata retrieval, full-text reading via arXiv HTML, ar5iv, or the PDF, and category taxonomy browsing."
type: software
authors:
